<title>USA: Porta extends exchange offer to June 30.</title>
<headline>Porta extends exchange offer to June 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYOSSET, N.Y. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Porta Systems Corp said Monday that it has extended until June 30 its offer to exchange its common shares and zero coupon senior subordinated convertible notes due January 2, 1998 for its 6 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2002.</p>
<p>So far, 94 percent of the debentures have been tendered and the company is pleased with the response, it said.</p>
<p>It said all tendered debentures have been processed.</p>
<p>Porta Systems designs, manufactures, markets and supports communications equipment used in voice, video and data networks worldwide.</p>
<p>--</p>
